('p1', 'aria-boucle-sofa', 'Aria Boucle Sofa', 'Sofas', 2480, null, 4.9, 128, '[{"name":"Oat","hex":"#E4DACB"},{"name":"Sand","hex":"#D6C4AC"},{"name":"Clay","hex":"#B99C82"}]'::jsonb, '["Boucle","Oak"]'::jsonb, '["https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_bc8720b5-6e55-4db5-ab5e-7e1cb1d90e42.jpg","https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_bc161c52-d519-4f80-bc42-dbfc55f9e646.jpg","https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_037e26cc-d3f9-459c-a41f-7a2a9cd3f51d.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Bestseller', true, 'A low, generous three-seater wrapped in a heavyweight wool boucle. The Aria is built on a solid oak frame with hand-tied springs, so it holds its shape through years of slow evenings.', 'W 224 × D 96 × H 72 cm · Seat height 42 cm', 'Vacuum weekly with a soft brush head. Blot spills immediately with a clean, dry cloth. Professional clean only.', (select id from public.stores order by name limit 1 offset 0)),
('p2', 'lune-boucle-armchair', 'Lune Boucle Armchair', 'Chairs', 890, null, 4.8, 86, '[{"name":"Cream","hex":"#EFE7DA"},{"name":"Camel","hex":"#C2A183"},{"name":"Charcoal","hex":"#4A443F"}]'::jsonb, '["Boucle","Beech"]'::jsonb, '["https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_85511e41-e6c6-4168-83e1-dc035a4bd11e.jpg","https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_037e26cc-d3f9-459c-a41f-7a2a9cd3f51d.jpg","https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_bc161c52-d519-4f80-bc42-dbfc55f9e646.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'New', true, 'A rounded reading chair with a deep scoop seat and a gently flared back. Upholstered in a nubby boucle that catches afternoon light.', 'W 82 × D 84 × H 74 cm · Seat height 40 cm', 'Rotate the cushion monthly. Keep out of direct sunlight to preserve the tone of the boucle.', (select id from public.stores order by name limit 1 offset 1)),
('p3', 'solstice-oak-dining-table', 'Solstice Oak Dining Table', 'Tables', 1650, null, 4.9, 64, '[{"name":"Natural Oak","hex":"#C9A87C"},{"name":"Smoked Oak","hex":"#8A6A4B"}]'::jsonb, '["Oak"]'::jsonb, '["https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_cee9a504-f621-4868-a038-89436d1e0ba9.jpg","https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_21994dac-df90-4d7d-90eb-8f0b5797078b.jpg","https://miaoda-site-img.s3cdn.medo.dev/images/KLing_03880be5-11f1-4480-a3ab-d645b111aea7.jpg"]'::jsonb, null, true, 'A softly rounded rectangular table cut from a single run of European oak. The hand-oiled finish deepens with age and everyday use.', 'L 200 × W 95 × H 75 cm', 'Wipe with a damp cloth. Re-oil twice a year with a natural furniture wax.', (select id from public.stores order by name limit 1 offset 2)),
